<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Nexo | Editar usuario</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="page-editor">
  <%- include('partials/ambient') %><%- include('partials/header', { activePage: 'users' }) %>
  <main class="editor-shell">
    <aside class="editor-intro reveal"><a class="back-link" href="/users">← REGRESAR</a><div class="signal"><i></i><span>EDITAR PERFIL</span><b>IDENTIDAD</b></div><h1>Actualiza sus datos.</h1><p>La fecha de creación permanecerá intacta y la fecha de actualización cambiará al guardar.</p><div class="editor-object"><div class="mini-cube"><span><%= user.name ? user.name.charAt(0) : 'N' %></span></div><i></i><i></i><i></i><small>USER<br>PROFILE</small></div></aside>
    <section class="editor-panel reveal"><div class="panel-heading"><span>DATOS DEL USUARIO</span><b>ACTUALIZACIÓN</b></div><form class="post-form" method="POST" action="/users/<%= user._id %>/edit">
      <% if(error){ %><div class="form-error" role="alert"><i>!</i><span><strong>No se pudo actualizar</strong><%= error %></span></div><% } %>
      <div class="field-row"><label><span><b>01</b>Nombre</span><input name="name" value="<%= user.name || '' %>" required></label><label><span><b>02</b>Apellido</span><input name="lastName" value="<%= user.lastName || '' %>" required></label></div>
      <label><span><b>03</b>Correo electrónico</span><input type="email" name="email" value="<%= user.email || '' %>" required></label>
      <div class="field-row"><label><span><b>04</b>Edad</span><input type="number" name="age" value="<%= user.age || '' %>" min="18" required></label><label><span><b>05</b>Teléfono</span><input type="tel" name="phoneNumber" value="<%= user.phoneNumber || '' %>"></label></div>
      <label><span><b>06</b>Nueva contraseña <em>opcional</em></span><input type="password" name="password" minlength="8" placeholder="Déjala vacía para conservar la actual" autocomplete="new-password"></label>
      <div class="date-info"><div><small>CREADO</small><strong><%= user.createdAt ? new Intl.DateTimeFormat('es-PE',{dateStyle:'medium',timeStyle:'short'}).format(new Date(user.createdAt)) : 'Fecha original conservada' %></strong></div><div><small>ÚLTIMA ACTUALIZACIÓN</small><strong><%= user.updatedAt ? new Intl.DateTimeFormat('es-PE',{dateStyle:'medium',timeStyle:'short'}).format(new Date(user.updatedAt)) : 'Sin modificaciones todavía' %></strong></div></div>
      <div class="form-actions"><a class="text-link" href="/users">Cancelar</a><button class="btn btn-glow" type="submit"><span>Guardar cambios</span><b>→</b></button></div>
    </form></section>
  </main><%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body></html>
